    "name": "Hoover Heroes",
    "steam_appid": 3453610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/39f3cb083fdfc2a3be6d961e504d924e.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/39f3cb083fdfc2a3be6d961e504d924e.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/39f3cb083fdfc2a3be6d961e504d924e.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoover Heroes is a physics-based multiplayer game where Kevins battle it out in chaotic arenas, supporting 2 to 8 players. The goal is simple: cause mayhem, take down your opponents, and dominate with your trusty vacuum. Every match turns into an unpredictable comedy show full of wild moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f01e6327b6ba4ae0a5c1cfd7079aa6ac.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f01e6327b6ba4ae0a5c1cfd7079aa6ac.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f01e6327b6ba4ae0a5c1cfd7079aa6ac.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Kevin\u2019s vacuum to suck in objects and launch them at your opponents. Control the chaos by interacting with the environment and don\u2019t forget to slap! Becoming Employee of the Month Kevin won\u2019t be easy. Sharpen your reflexes, read your rivals\u2019 moves, and rule the arena with your vacuum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f61c316f20d71841f78095f58686f89f.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f61c316f20d71841f78095f58686f89f.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f61c316f20d71841f78095f58686f89f.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map features a unique design that keeps the gameplay fresh and fun. Every arena demands different strategies; jump on beds, watch out for deep waters, and avoid UFOs! Fight with your team, be the last Kevin standing, or kick the ball with the hardest shot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/3884c3838065166dbc3b19088f20adfc.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/3884c3838065166dbc3b19088f20adfc.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/3884c3838065166dbc3b19088f20adfc.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each costume adds its own flair to the team. Who\u2019s the sharpest dresser is up for debate, but who stays standing is what really matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress to impress\u2026 or just to make a mess!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/e10c7c2fe345b8fac665ab21f8c1e10d.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/e10c7c2fe345b8fac665ab21f8c1e10d.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/e10c7c2fe345b8fac665ab21f8c1e10d.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not interested in simple objects? Then wreak havoc with the Black Hole, set Bear Traps for your opponents, or electrify Kevin with the Plasma Ball. Thanks to these special items, every match turns into a fun-filled surprise!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/39f3cb083fdfc2a3be6d961e504d924e.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/39f3cb083fdfc2a3be6d961e504d924e.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/39f3cb083fdfc2a3be6d961e504d924e.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoover Heroes is a physics-based multiplayer game where Kevins battle it out in chaotic arenas, supporting 2 to 8 players. The goal is simple: cause mayhem, take down your opponents, and dominate with your trusty vacuum. Every match turns into an unpredictable comedy show full of wild moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f01e6327b6ba4ae0a5c1cfd7079aa6ac.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f01e6327b6ba4ae0a5c1cfd7079aa6ac.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/f01e6327b6ba4ae0a5c1cfd7079aa6ac.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Kevin\u2019s vacuum to suck in objects and launch them at your opponents. Control the chaos by interacting with the environment and don\u2019t forget to slap! Becoming Employee of the Month Kevin won\u2019t be easy. Sharpen your reflexes, read your rivals\u2019 moves, and rule the arena with your vacuum!</p><p class=\