as/e10c7c2fe345b8fac665ab21f8c1e10d.poster.avif?t=1753988895\" width=1138 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/e10c7c2fe345b8fac665ab21f8c1e10d.webm?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453610/extras/e10c7c2fe345b8fac665ab21f8c1e10d.mp4?t=1753988895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not interested in simple objects? Then wreak havoc with the Black Hole, set Bear Traps for your opponents, or electrify Kevin with the Plasma Ball. Thanks to these special items, every match turns into a fun-filled surprise!</p>",
